## Summary

I've thoroughly explored the label and i18n system in the compose sketchpad/ui. Here are my findings:

---

## **1. `useLabel` Hook Definition**

**Location:** [elements/ui/index.tsx](elements/ui/index.tsx#L9763)

The hook resolves localized labels by i18n key and handles expertise-level variations:

```typescript
export function useLabel(id: string): string | undefined {
  const { t } = useTranslation();
  const expertise = _expertiseProvider ? _expertiseProvider() : Expertise.NORMAL;
  const value = t(id as any) as any;

  if (typeof value === "string") {
    return value;
  }

  if (value && typeof value === "object" && "label" in value) {
    const label = value.label;
    if (typeof label === "string") return label;

    if (label && typeof label === "object") {
      if (expertise === Expertise.BEGINNER && "beginner" in label && label.beginner !== undefined) {
        return String(label.beginner);
      }
      if ("normal" in label && label.normal !== undefined) {
        return String(label.normal);
      }
      if ("beginner" in label && label.beginner !== undefined) {
        return String(label.beginner);
      }
    }
  }
  return undefined;
}
```

**Function:** Translates i18n keys to localized strings, supporting expertise levels (BEGINNER, NORMAL, EXPERT).

---

## **2. `showLabel` Prop Implementation**

The `showLabel` prop wraps components with a [Label](#label-component) component that renders localized labels.

### **Slider** [elements/ui/index.tsx](elements/ui/index.tsx#L12640-L12780)
```typescript
function Slider({
  className,
  id,
  showLabel,
  value,
  onValueChange,
  // ...
}: /* props */) {
  // ... slider implementation ...

  if (showLabel) {
    return (
      <Label id={id} labelElementId={`${id}-label`} className={className}>
        {sliderContent}
      </Label>
    );
  }
  return sliderContent;
}
```

### **ToggleGroup** [elements/ui/index.tsx](elements/ui/index.tsx#L13405-L13415)
```typescript
function ToggleGroup({ className, id, showLabel, items, kind = "single", ...restProps }: ToggleGroupProps) {
  // ... toggle group items ...

  if (showLabel && id) {
    return (
      <Label id={id} labelElementId={`${id}-label`}>
        {toggleGroupElement}
      </Label>
    );
  }
  return toggleGroupElement;
}
```

### **Select** [elements/ui/index.tsx](elements/ui/index.tsx#L12419-L12467)
```typescript
function Select({ id, showLabel, children, value, defaultValue, onOpenChange, ...props }: 
  React.ComponentProps<typeof SelectPrimitive.Root> & ElementProps & { showLabel?: boolean }) {
  // ... select implementation ...

  if (showLabel && id) {
    return (
      <Label id={id} labelElementId={`${id}-label`}>
        {selectElement}
      </Label>
    );
  }
}
```

---

## **3. I18n Translation Files (JSON)**

**Location:** All translations are embedded in code at [elements/ui/index.tsx](elements/ui/index.tsx#L139)

**Structure:** `elementUiTranslationBundles` object with language keys (`en`, `de`) containing nested JSON:

```typescript
const elementUiTranslationBundles = {
  de: {
    translation: JSON.parse(String.raw`{
  "compose": {
    "sketchpad": {
      "navbar": {
        "back": {
          "label": {
            "normal": "Zurueck",
            "beginner": "Klicken, um zurueckzugehen..."
          },
          "hotkey": "Alt+Links"
        }
        // ... more entries
      }
    }
  }
}`)
  },
  en: { translation: { /* ... */ } }
}
```

**Used in:** [compose/sketchpad/index.tsx](compose/sketchpad/index.tsx#L188)
```typescript
import { elementUiI18n as i18n } from "@compose/ui";
```

---

## **4. Label Component**

**Location:** [elements/ui/index.tsx](elements/ui/index.tsx#L10773)

Renders labels from IDs using `useLabel` hook:

```typescript
export function Label({ id, rowId, label, labelElementId, className, children }: LabelProps) {
  const localizedLabel = useLabel(id);
  const resolvedLabel = label ?? localizedLabel;

  // ... renders label text from i18n key + wrapped content ...

  return (
    <div className="group grid min-w-0 items-center gap-x-[8px] min-h-[24px]">
      <span id={labelElementId} className="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-medium">
        {resolvedLabel}
      </span>
      <div className="property-control">
        {children}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

---

## **Real-World Usage Example**

From [compose/sketchpad/index.tsx](compose/sketchpad/index.tsx#L17604):

```typescript
<TreeRow>
  <Slider
    id="compose.sketchpad.app.kit.settings.diagram.chargeStrength"
    showLabel  // ← Enables label rendering
    min={-500}
    max={0}
    step={10}
    value={[diagramForce.chargeStrength]}
    onValueChange={(value: number[]) => setDiagramForce?.({ chargeStrength: value[0] })}
  />
</TreeRow>

<TreeRow>
  <ToggleGroup
    id="compose.sketchpad.app.kit.settings.theme"
    showLabel
    items={[/* ... */]}
  />
</TreeRow>

<TreeRow>
  <Select 
    id="compose.sketchpad.app.kit.settings.language" 
    showLabel
  >
    {/* ... */}
  </Select>
</TreeRow>
```

---

## **Translation Keys Structure**

Keys follow the pattern: `compose.sketchpad.<app>.<feature>.<component>`

They support expertise-level variants:
```json
"compose.sketchpad.app.kit.settings.theme": {
  "label": {
    "normal": "Theme name",
    "beginner": "Beginner-friendly description"
  }
}
```

